[ti:Ek Ghade]
[ar:VESAHE · hkfaduio]
[al:Sufi & Qawwali]
[by:Radio Vaigyaaniq — draft timing, unverified]
[00:08.00]Ek chilam... ek baabaa... do ghade ka khel...
[00:14.63]Ek ghada tha poora... ek thaa toota...
[00:21.27]Aaj maine ajab tamaashaa dekha
[00:27.90]Baabaa aur do ghade sang khel
[00:34.54]Subah shaam wo ghade uthaave
[00:41.17]Pani bhare rojana kaam
[00:47.80]Toota ghada roya, aansu bahaaya
[00:54.44]Haye re mere baabaa
[01:01.07]Teri mehnat bekaar jaaye
[01:07.71]Tu roj bhaare, main roj giraaun
[01:14.34]Teri pyaas bhi na bujh paaye
[01:20.98]Baabaa bole – mat ro re deewaane
[01:27.61]Jo raste pe phool khile hain
[01:34.24]Wo teri boondon ke hai bahaane
[01:40.88]Kuch bhi vyarth nahi jaaye ✨
[01:54.15]Tan par maans naam baraabar
[02:00.78]Kandhe jhoole janeu dhaagaa
[02:07.41]Main hoon toota, main hoon bekaar
[02:14.05]Mujhse kyun uthaaye baabaa?
[02:20.68]Baabaa bole – mat ro re deewaane
[02:27.32]Jo raste pe phool khile hain
[02:33.95]Wo teri boondon ke hai bahaane
[02:40.59]Kuch bhi vyarth nahi jaaye ✨
[02:47.22]Tu dekhe jo phool raah mein khilte
[02:53.85]Hariyali chhaayi, mahak uthi hai
[03:00.49]Wo teri ek ek boond ka karishma
[03:07.12]Tu khud ko anjaan rakhti hai
[03:13.76]Lead: Main andha tha!
[03:20.39]Lead: Apni darar ko rog samjha!
[03:27.02]Lead: Par teri nazar ne rang dikhaaya!
[03:33.66]Lead: Mera wo chhed – mera hi geet ban gaya!
[03:40.29]Toota ghada gaaye! Toota ghada gaaye!
[03:46.93]Baabaa bole – mat ro deewaane
[03:53.56]Jo lage vyarth wohi saphal hai
[04:00.20]Har boond mein saagar hai
[04:06.83]Kuch bhi vyarth nahi jaaye
[04:13.46]Aaj nahi to kal wapas!
[04:20.10]Kal wapas! Kal wapas!
[04:26.73]Nahi akaarth koi karm...
[04:33.37]Sab aaj nahi... to kal wapas...
